# Normalize all text files to LF in the working tree on every platform.
# Without this, the Windows CI runner (core.autocrlf) checks out golden
# fixtures and the embedded core.md as CRLF, and the byte-exact compose golden
# comparison fails while producing a CRLF system prompt (spec §3 requires
# byte-stable LF output). Binary files are auto-detected and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
